   "id": "half-of-it-was-replaced-and-half-just-stopped",
   "kind": "measured",
   "literals": [],
   "not_shown": "Which grant, and which post. DESE reports a fund total and names neither, so a general fund rise beside a grant fall is equally consistent with the town picking a cost up and with two unrelated things happening in one function in one year. Nor does a reduction establish that a service ended.",
   "see": [
